{"hw":"πένης","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">πένης</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">πένης</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ητος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">πένομαι</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one who works for his living, day-labourer, poor</b> man, opp. <span class=\"gk\">πλούσιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Democr.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">283</span> </span>; opp. <span class=\"gk\">δυνάμενος</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Archyt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πτωχοῦ μὲν γὰρ βίος.., ζῆν ἐστιν μηδὲν ἔχοντα: τοῦ δὲ πένητος ζῆν φει-</span> <span class=\"gk\">δόμενον καὶ τοῖς ἔργοις προσέχοντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">553</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἱ π. αὐτῶν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.133</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.47</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πλούσιος ἐκ πένητος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">πένητες ἄνθρωποι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.51</span> </span>; <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οἷ'</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἀνὴρ π</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">584</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. ἵππος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Oec.</cite> <spa